3
00:00:07,625 --> 00:00:08,958
- Cool!
- Wow!
- Amazing!
- Lame!

4
00:00:09,166 --> 00:00:10,458
I'm spinning seven!

5
00:00:10,458 --> 00:00:13,000
You think anyone cares?!

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,791
How many can you do, Needy?

7
00:00:15,791 --> 00:00:17,375
[SLOWED DOWN]
Needy?

8
00:00:17,375 --> 00:00:19,666
[EVEN MORE SLOWED DOWN]
Needy?

9
00:00:19,666 --> 00:00:21,041
[EVEN MORE SLOWED DOWN]
Nee-

10
